     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>I&#39;m trying to create a message system in a shiny app, that gets \r\nnotifications when certain tasks are done, but presently it does not \r\nwork:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br></p><p>UI:</p><p><br></p><p></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><pre><code><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;My Dashboard&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  dropdownMenuOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;messageMenu&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Hi&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;go&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;DO STUFF!&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;go2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span